export anchor PowerUserStyle:
    number: 401
    screen: EmailClient
    name: Power user
    idea: A dense, keyboard first mail client on near black, with thirty pixel rows, a key hint beside every action and folder, a command field on top and a lime modal status line along the bottom.
    base: dark
    palette:
        base: #0d0f14, the page, the list and fields
        panel: #141720, the command bar, the folder column, column headers and the style sheet
        zebra: #11131a, alternate list rows
        line: #252a37, dividers
        key: #1e2230, keycap faces
        keyEdge: #3a4052, keycap borders
        text: #d9dde7, body text
        sub: #8f97ab, snippets and meta
        lime: #c4f23a, the selection bar, the status line, the primary button and focus
        onLime: #142000, text on lime
        sel: #1d2614, the selected row and current folder
        pink: #ff8ad8, the unread dot
        amber: #ffc95c, the starred star
        cyan: #6fd6ff, bracketed label text
    type:
        A sans stack, Inter, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, at a 13px
        base. The open subject is 17px at 650, the body 14px at 1.6, unread
        rows 700 in pure white. A mono stack, JetBrains Mono, SF Mono,
        ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, sets the app name, times, labels,
        header fields, column heads at 10px caps and keycaps at 11px.
    layout:
        A thin command bar holds bw/mail in lime mono, a wide field led by a
        slash keycap reading search or command with an example query, the
        hints for commands and keys as keycaps, and mara.okafor. Three
        panes fill the window height. A 172px folder column lists folders
        and labels in tight rows, each with a count where needed and a two
        letter key hint such as gi or l1. Inbox has a lime inset bar. The
        list is a sticky headed grid with columns Flags, From, Subject,
        Label and Time, 30px zebra rows, the subject in normal weight
        followed by a muted snippet, labels in brackets. The selected
        Northpass row has a lime bar and a caret. The reader has a toolbar
        of small buttons each with its key, Reply in lime, the subject,
        a mono key and value block for from, to, date, label and state, the
        body and a dashed card of six more shortcuts. A full width lime
        status line at the bottom shows NORMAL, inbox 1/6, 2 unread, hints
        and the sync time. Below 1100px the reader spans under the list and
        the label column hides. On a phone rows become two lines, the list
        comes first, then the reader, then the folders two across.
    spacing: A 4px base. 10px side padding, 30px rows, 26px buttons, 1px gaps in grids.
    density: Very high. Five column rows, key hints, a shortcut card and a status line on one screen.
    corners: 4px buttons and fields, 3px keycaps, square panes.
    borders: 1px #252a37 between panes. Keycaps have a 2px bottom edge.
    shadows: None. Selection is a 2px lime inset bar plus a caret.
    icons:
        No icon set, only text glyphs. A pink dot for unread, an amber star
        for starred, a plus for an attachment, and labels in square
        brackets, each also stated in words for screen readers and in the
        reader state field.
    focus: A 1px lime inset outline plus a 3px translucent lime ring.
    tone: Terse and lowercase for data, such as yday, from, inbox 1/6 and NORMAL.
